Third-party data.  nasa-exoplanet-archive-ps-20261101.csv is an unmodified extract of the NASA
Exoplanet Archive's Planetary Systems table (query of 2026-11-01). It is reproduced for provenance
and is not covered by the CC BY 4.0 grant above. If you use it, please acknowledge: "This research
has made use of the NASA Exoplanet Archive, which is operated by the California Institute of
Technology, under contract with the National Aeronautics and Space Administration under the
Exoplanet Exploration Program." The orbital solution it contains is that of L. J. Rosenthal et al.,
ApJS 255 (2021) 8; please cite that paper as well.
